| [G08E01 · Raider Chief](/wiki/Hostile-Group-G08/#g08e01) | Person | Pack or unit | Front place of the positive-pressure doors and the sack allotment | Leader | M012 |
| [G08E08 · Raider Elite Squad](/wiki/Hostile-Group-G08/#g08e08) | Person | Pack or unit | Between the sacks, the curtains, and the doors | Elite | M012 |
| [G08E15 · Raider Scouts](/wiki/Hostile-Group-G08/#g08e15) | Person | Single individual | Movement time at the end of the alley and the duct mouth | Strategic encounter | M013 |

