<a id="Hostile-Group-G20-heading-0019"></a>
<a id="g20e15"></a>

### G20E15 · One-legged Dokkaebi

- Source batch: M032
- Former role class: Strategic encounter
- Links: {"states":["arc","free-city"],"synthetics":["F04"],"theaters":["XT05"]}

| Bestiary item | Record |
|---|---|
